## CrosshairApi

### Crosshair Code Image
## Crosshair Code Image
GET https://api.deadlock-api.com/v1/crosshair/code/image?code={{code}}&screenHeight={{screenHeight}}
Accept: image/png

### Crosshair Settings Code
## Crosshair Settings Code
GET https://api.deadlock-api.com/v1/crosshair/settings/code?themed={{themed}}&pipGapStatic={{pipGapStatic}}&pipWidth={{pipWidth}}&pipHeight={{pipHeight}}&pipGap={{pipGap}}&pipOpacity={{pipOpacity}}&pipOutlineBorder={{pipOutlineBorder}}&pipOutlineGap={{pipOutlineGap}}&pipOutlineOpacity={{pipOutlineOpacity}}&dotSize={{dotSize}}&dotOpacity={{dotOpacity}}&dotOutlineBorder={{dotOutlineBorder}}&dotOutlineGap={{dotOutlineGap}}&dotOutlineOpacity={{dotOutlineOpacity}}&colorR={{colorR}}&colorG={{colorG}}&colorB={{colorB}}&outlineColorR={{outlineColorR}}&outlineColorG={{outlineColorG}}&outlineColorB={{outlineColorB}}
Accept: application/json

### Crosshair Settings Image
## Crosshair Settings Image
GET https://api.deadlock-api.com/v1/crosshair/settings/image?themed={{themed}}&pipGapStatic={{pipGapStatic}}&pipWidth={{pipWidth}}&pipHeight={{pipHeight}}&pipGap={{pipGap}}&pipOpacity={{pipOpacity}}&pipOutlineBorder={{pipOutlineBorder}}&pipOutlineGap={{pipOutlineGap}}&pipOutlineOpacity={{pipOutlineOpacity}}&dotSize={{dotSize}}&dotOpacity={{dotOpacity}}&dotOutlineBorder={{dotOutlineBorder}}&dotOutlineGap={{dotOutlineGap}}&dotOutlineOpacity={{dotOutlineOpacity}}&colorR={{colorR}}&colorG={{colorG}}&colorB={{colorB}}&outlineColorR={{outlineColorR}}&outlineColorG={{outlineColorG}}&outlineColorB={{outlineColorB}}&screenHeight={{screenHeight}}
Accept: image/png
